  "description": "The E314.Exceptions module provides enhanced exception classes that improve standard error handling mechanisms in .NET. These exceptions include additional data such as a unique error code (ErrorCode), extra data (ErrorData), the file name, method name, and line number where the exception occurred. This makes debugging and logging more informative.",
